  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "City guards in Shang Clan City name him lord clan leader when they recognise him beside Shang Xin Ci.",
      "chapters": [
        259
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_shang_clan_city",
        "char_shang_xin_ci"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At that stage he is rank five upper stage, only a step from peak. Shang clan is a Southern Border overlord seated on that city and mountain line.",
      "chapters": [
        258
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shang_clan",
        "reg_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He sits cross-legged in the air with his whole body bathing in flames. The flames are scarlet like blood and burn silently. When the cultivation ends, the scarlet flames shrink and change back into long crimson hair on his head. His pupils are dyed the color of blood.",
      "chapters": [
        258
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "On a city street he is a black-robed, crimson-haired handsome man, conspicuous in the crowd. Shang Xin Ci knows this middle-aged man’s identity at a glance.",
      "chapters": [
        259
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At a clan banquet he wears a white robe with gold inlaid cuffs. Scarlet hair flies around wildly before resting on his waist, and that hair with his extremely handsome face forms an aura unique to him. He looks like a youth in his twenties.",
      "chapters": [
        269
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a famous handsome man of Southern Border, entangled with Doctor Su Shou in the eyes of Killer Ghost Doctor Chou Jiu.",
      "chapters": [
        385
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_doctor_su_shou",
        "char_chou_jiu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Before he held the seat he was a Shang young master who gave up that post under pressure from a rival alliance, lived as an ordinary clansman in a private residence during that fallen period, and later kept that residence after becoming clan leader as a reminder for himself and later generations.",
      "chapters": [
        269
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "clan-leader-and-rise",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wei Yang rose under him from the battle stages and became an external elder once Shang Yan Fei took power.",
      "chapters": [
        265
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "clan-leader-and-rise",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wei_yang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wei Yang is one of the five great generals under him; Shang Bu Li is named the number one general, and Yi Huo the fifth.",
      "chapters": [
        269
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "clan-leader-and-rise",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shang_bu_li",
        "char_yi_huo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Above the ten young masters sits young clan leader Shang Tuo Hai, and above him sit the five elders, Shang Yan Fei, and the Shang supreme elder.",
      "chapters": [
        333
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "clan-leader-and-rise",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shang_tuo_hai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In those years he is still rank five upper stage and an expert at the peak of the mortal world.",
      "chapters": [
        353
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "clan-leader-and-rise",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "On San Cha Mountain, Tie Mu Bai’s rank five peak cultivation leaves Shang Yan Fei inferior despite his astonishing talent.",
      "chapters": [
        370
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "clan-leader-and-rise",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_san_cha_mountain",
        "char_tie_mu_bai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He meets Shang Xin Ci on the street, reads her as the daughter of the Zhang clan lady he once abandoned for power, and takes her away after she faints.",
      "chapters": [
        259
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "elevating-shang-xin-ci",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_zhang_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At a clan banquet in the old courtyard he thanks Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing for escorting her, and he announces her as his daughter before the young masters.",
      "chapters": [
        269
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "elevating-shang-xin-ci",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_bai_ning_bing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He spreads dishes with rank five gourmet food box Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        269
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "elevating-shang-xin-ci",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_gourmet_food_box_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He offers to clear Bai clan’s arrest warrant and presses further rewards; Fang Yuan refuses that brand, and only after Wei Yang coaches him does he ask for tokens, which Shang Yan Fei answers with purple thorn tokens.",
      "chapters": [
        271
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "elevating-shang-xin-ci",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_bai_clan_bai_gu_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He uses man triumphing heaven Gu to awaken Shang Xin Ci’s aperture and spends costly Gu to raise her aptitude from D grade twenty percent to C grade fifty-nine percent, and he chooses many Gu Masters to teach her.",
      "chapters": [
        305
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "elevating-shang-xin-ci",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_man_triumphing_heaven_gu",
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan also knows Shang Yan Fei has been collecting the Blood Sea true inheritance and would want blood skull Gu to raise her further.",
      "chapters": [
        302
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "elevating-shang-xin-ci",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_blood_sea_true_inheritance",
        "gu_demonic_blood_skull_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Fang Yuan’s earlier life, Shang Yan Fei was one of the heads of the righteous alliance at Yi Tian Mountain, and gourmet food box Gu already marked him there when he fed the allied armies.",
      "chapters": [
        269
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yi-tian-mountain-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In that same earlier life Chou Jiu dies after challenging him at Yi Tian Mountain and exposing the Su Shou history.",
      "chapters": [
        385
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yi-tian-mountain-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the present Yi Tian Mountain war he again arrives with forces and uses gourmet food box Gu to feed the army when demonic path cuts supply lines.",
      "chapters": [
        966
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yi-tian-mountain-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shang Bi Xi tells Shang Xin Ci that their father has died.",
      "chapters": [
        1059
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yi-tian-mountain-death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shang_bi_xi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later accounts place that death on Yi Tian Mountain, and Shang Xin Ci becomes Shang clan’s new clan leader. Of his five great generals only Shang Bu Li and Wan Qian Shan remain.",
      "chapters": [
        1072
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yi-tian-mountain-death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu clan talk names him as the earlier Shang clan leader who took a Blood Sea Ancestor true inheritance and blood handprint Gu from the blood tide pit, after which blood tides kept rising there.",
      "chapters": [
        1339
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-taken-from-pit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_wu_clan",
        "char_blood_sea_ancestor",
        "gu_blood_handprint_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "That obtainment sits in his mortal Gu Master years, before Wu clan held the pit as a resource point, and Fang Yuan already knew in Shang Clan City that he was collecting Blood Sea true inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        1341
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-taken-from-pit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He had died on Yi Tian Mountain, but after fate Gu’s destruction he is revived by Shang clan’s Gu Immortals. He succeeds in immortal ascension as a blood path Gu Immortal, tells his children to keep that path secret, and begins distributing family assets before closed cultivation.",
      "chapters": [
        2121
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blood-path-immortal",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_fate_gu",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He gives Shang Xin Ci the old house that once marked his own fallen period, and the gift is read as meaning he is giving her the clan leader position.",
      "chapters": [
        2122
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "house-and-clan-leadership-gift",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After that role transfer, righteous path rules stop him from intervening if she is later driven from the seat.",
      "chapters": [
        2123
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "righteous-path-non-intervention",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
